        {
          "path": "_m/tpc/be/re/nt/y-/berenty-reserve/berenty-reserve.jpg",
          "filename": "Berenty reserve.jpg",
          "caption": "We spent three weeks in Madagascar. From 'Tana we  went to Berenty, then Fort Dauphin. Ranomaphana, Isalo N/P, Tulear, Anakoa, Ifaty, Ampijoroa, Andasibe, and finally Perinet and Mantadia N/P.\nIt remains for me The most unusual and fascinating place we have travelled to.\n\nMuch of their flora and fauna remains unique but is disappearing fast.\n\nSo go there if you possibly can, you will love it.",
